{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Ozanari Dungeon: Kaze no Tou","The king of the Tower of Wind seeks the power of the legendary Dragon's Head, and employs the fighter Moka, the thief Buruman, and the magic user Kiriman to steal it for him. But the Dragon's Head is sealed in the Temple of Fire, and to capture it Moka will have to face the sect that has protected it generation after generation!\n\n\n(Source: AniDB)"],"ja":["おざなりダンジョン 風の塔",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-3065","ids":{"shikimori":3065,"mal":3065,"anilist":3065,"kodik":"serial-24231"},"kodikIds":["serial-24231"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-24231":"2020-03-30T13:51:39Z"},"title":"Темница Одзанари: Башня ветра","originalTitle":"Ozanari Dungeon: Kaze no Tou","alt":"おざなりダンジョン 風の塔 おざなりダンジョン 風の塔","description":"Король Башни ветра ищет легендарный артефакт, Голову Дракона, и нанимает девушку-воина Моку , вора Бурумана и мага Киримана , чтобы они украли голову. Голова Дракона спрятана в Храме огня, и, чтобы получить её, герои должны столкнуться лицом к лицу с сектой, охраняющей артефакт на протяжении многих поколений.","year":1991,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Комедия","Фэнтези"],"rating":6.54,"popularity":1283,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/3065/c120b0a157dc0d44c70793f1f466a055.jpeg","width":370,"height":370},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/2494a36a1c5e5375f161ce40af073a9b6e6fa504.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-827","dubId":"827","label":"Persona99","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-24231","translationId":"827","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/621272/3579aee8eb1be8b3d404a9ed7830f39c/720p","season":1,"ordina